#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Keiner
msgctxt "160_Hana"
msgid "Oh, Chief. You have a customer waiting."
msgstr "Oh, jefe. Tiene un cliente esperándole."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Keiner
#. y4:reviewed_by=Keiner
msgctxt "172_Akiyama"
msgid "The one you told me about on the phone? Got it. Thanks."
msgstr "¿La persona de la que me hablaste? Gracias."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Keiner
#. y4:reviewed_by=Keiner
msgctxt "244_Akiyama"
msgid "Apologies for the wait. So, tell me, what brings you here\\r\ntoday?"
msgstr "Perdone la tardanza. Ahora, cuénteme, ¿qué le trae aquí hoy?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Keiner
#. y4:reviewed_by=Keiner
msgctxt "256_Man Seeking a Loan"
msgid "Are you Akiyama-san? You provide interest-free loans here,\\r\nis that right?"
msgstr "¿Es usted Akiyama-san? Escuché que ofrece préstamos sin intereses, ¿es cierto?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Keiner
#. y4:reviewed_by=Keiner
msgctxt "268_Akiyama"
msgid "Indeed I do. That said, there are a few conditions. May I ask\\r\nyour name?"
msgstr "En efecto. Pero hay unas cuantas condiciones.\nLo primero,¿cómo se llama?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Keiner
#. y4:reviewed_by=Keiner
msgctxt "280_Shiobara"
msgid "It's Shiobara. Uh... How much are you willing to lend out,\\r\ner, usually?"
msgstr "Shiobara. Eh... Me gustaría saber, ¿qué cantidad suele prestar habitualmente?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Keiner
msgctxt "292_Akiyama"
msgid "Mind telling me why you need the money first? That'll help me decide whether or not I should give you the loan."
msgstr "Así que Shiobara-san. ¿Puede decirme para qué necesita el dinero exactamente? Eso me ayudará a decidir si debo o no darte el préstamo."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Keiner
#. y4:reviewed_by=Keiner
msgctxt "304_Shiobara"
msgid "Well, not too long ago, I drove my printing company into bankruptcy. I'd inherited the place from my father, you see."
msgstr "Verá, no hace mucho, llevé una imprenta a la quiebra. Era una que había heredado de mi padre."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Keiner
msgctxt "316_Hana"
msgid "But this time I figure I'll start my own company. From the ground up."
msgstr "Así que esta vez pienso comenzar mi propia empresa desde cero."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Keiner
msgctxt "328_Akiyama"
msgid "You ran your father's company into the ground?"
msgstr "¿Arruinaste la empresa de tu padre?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Keiner
msgctxt "340_Shiobara"
msgid "It made money, but not enough to get out of the red. In the end, all I could do was downsize. But downsizing isn't always the best option, you know?"
msgstr "Generaba ganancias, pero no las suficientes para cubrir las pérdidas. Al final, la única opción viable era reducir personal. Pero, despedir gente a lo loco está mal, ¿verdad?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Keiner
msgctxt "352_Hana"
msgid "The company was already on its way under. If our only available option was downsizing, wouldn't it have been better to just pull the plug?"
msgstr "Bueno, la empresa ya estaba casi quebrada. Si la única solución era despedir empleados, ¿por qué no cerrarla de una vez?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Keiner
msgctxt "364_F_oba_sitchr_tlk_kamae"
msgid "I think it's cowardly to fire people just to try and keep a company artificially afloat."
msgstr "Me parece injusto tener que despedir a alguien solo por intentar mantener la empresa a flote."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "376_Talk_Yes"
msgid "So I took responsibility for my bad management and let the place go bankrupt. No hard feelings all around, right?"
msgstr "Así que asumí la responsabilidad de mi mala gestión y dejé que la empresa quebrara. De esa manera no habría dramas, ¿no crees?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Keiner
msgctxt "388_Akiyama"
msgid "(I see. Spoken like a typical spoiled heir...)"
msgstr "(Ya entiendo. Son palabras de un típico heredero mimado...)."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Keiner
#. y4:reviewed_by=Keiner
msgctxt "400_Shiobara"
msgid "The old company doesn't matter now anyway. What's important is getting this new company off the ground. So... Will you lend me some money?"
msgstr "Pero mejor nos olvidamos de esa antigua empresa. Lo que importa ahora mismo es arrancar con esta nueva. Así que pues... ¿sería tan generoso de prestarme dinero?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Keiner
msgctxt "424_Akiyama"
msgid "I'm not against the idea, but why come to me? Can't you get your bank to cover it?"
msgstr "No me parece mal, pero ¿por qué yo? ¿Por qué no le pidió un préstamo al banco?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Keiner
msgctxt "436_Shiobara"
msgid "I guess I didn't pass their review. They asked me what business the company would be in, but I hadn't decided yet. Something online, that's for sure."
msgstr "Supongo que fue porque no pasé su evaluación. Me preguntaron qué tipo de negocio sería, pero aún no lo tengo claro... aunque de seguro que termina siendo algo relacionado al internet."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Keiner
msgctxt "448_Akiyama"
msgid "Still haven't figured it out, huh?"
msgstr "Así que sigues sin tenerlo claro, ¿eh?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Keiner
msgctxt "460_Shiobara"
msgid "What, you need planning documents, too? Don't you loan sharks usually skip all that formality crap?"
msgstr "¿Cómo? ¿También necesita planes de negocio? ¿No que los prestamistas informales omiten toda esa basura?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Keiner
#. y4:reviewed_by=Keiner
msgctxt "472_Akiyama"
msgid "No, it's just... Never mind. How much did you need?"
msgstr "No, es solo que... Olvídalo. Entonces dígame, ¿cuánto necesita?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Keiner
#. y4:reviewed_by=Keiner
msgctxt "484_Shiobara"
msgid "Let's see. How about three－no, five million?"
msgstr "Veamos. ¡Tres... no, mejor cinco millones!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Keiner
#. y4:reviewed_by=Keiner
msgctxt "496_Akiyama"
msgid "Why so much? Though now that I think about it... you probably have no idea how much you really need."
msgstr "¿Por qué tanto? Aunque seguro que no tiene ni idea de cuánto necesita."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Keiner
msgctxt "508_P_sitsofa_tlk_kamae"
msgid "Eh, what the hell. I'll lend you the five mil. No interest, no collateral."
msgstr "Bueno, ya qué. Te prestaré los cinco millones. Sin intereses, ni garantías."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Keiner
msgctxt "520_Shiobara"
msgid "Seriously!? You're not pulling my leg here?"
msgstr "¡¿De verdad?! ¿Está hablando en serio?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Keiner
#. y4:reviewed_by=Keiner
msgctxt "544_Akiyama"
msgid "But first, you're going to have to pass my test."
msgstr "Pero antes, tendrá que superar mi prueba."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Keiner
msgctxt "556_Shiobara"
msgid "Sure! Bring it on! I don't know what kind of test you're talking about, but I'll do anything you ask!"
msgstr "¡Por supuesto! ¡Claro que lo haré! ¡No sé qué tipo de prueba será, pero estoy seguro que la pasaré!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Keiner
#. y4:reviewed_by=Keiner
msgctxt "568_Akiyama"
msgid "All right. So you want to start a company, be its president?\\r\nIn that case, I'll need you to..."
msgstr "Perfecto. ¿Así que quiere fundar una empresa y ser su\ndirector? En ese caso..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Keiner
#. y4:reviewed_by=Keiner
msgctxt "580_Akiyama"
msgid "Find three people to be your business partners and bring\\r\nthem to me."
msgstr "Busca a tres personas que quieran ser sus socios comerciales\ny tráelos conmigo."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Keiner
msgctxt "604_Shiobara"
msgid "Business partners? Three of them? Is that really all you\\r\nneed?"
msgstr "¿Tres socios comerciales? ¿Eso es todo lo que necesita?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Keiner
#. y4:reviewed_by=Keiner
msgctxt "616_Akiyama"
msgid "Yeah. People who'd be happy to help build up a company.\\r\nWhat do you think? Can you do it?"
msgstr "Sí. Personas que estén dispuestas a ayudarlo a levantar\nuna empresa. ¿Qué dice? ¿Puede hacerlo?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Keiner
#. y4:reviewed_by=Keiner
msgctxt "628_Shiobara"
msgid "What are you talking about? I've got tons of friends. It\\r\nwon't take long at all!"
msgstr "¿Está bromeando? Tengo muchísimos amigos.\n¡Será pan comido!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Keiner
#. y4:reviewed_by=Keiner
msgctxt "640_Talk_OK"
msgid "I'll be right back, okay? Better get that five million\\r\nfor me!"
msgstr "Volveré enseguida. ¡Será mejor que tenga esos\ncinco millones listos!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Keiner
#. y4:reviewed_by=Keiner
msgctxt "712_Akiyama"
msgid "Bring me the business cards of ten company presidents. Any\\r\nkind of company will do."
msgstr "Consígame las tarjetas de presentación de diez presidentes\nde cualquier empresa. Cualquier tipo de empresa vale."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Keiner
msgctxt "736_Shiobara"
msgid "Ten business cards? Is that really all you need?"
msgstr "¿Diez tarjetas de presentación? ¿Solo eso?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Keiner
#. y4:reviewed_by=Keiner
msgctxt "748_Akiyama"
msgid "Corporate CEOs, presidents of small factories－take your\\r\npick. Just find ten of them, get their cards, and bring them\\r\nhere."
msgstr "Grandes CEO's, presidentes de pequeños emprendimientos,\nlo que sea. Encuentra a diez, consiga sus tarjetas y\ntráigalas."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Keiner
msgctxt "760_Shiobara"
msgid "Are you sure? That sounds pretty easy. I mean, I used to be\\r\na president myself. I can get twenty or even thirty cards,\\r\nno problem."
msgstr "¿Está seguro? Eso parece bastante sencillo. Yo mismo fui\\r\ndirector al fin y al cabo. Puedo conseguir veinte o incluso\\r\ntreinta tarjetas, sin problema."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "772_Akiyama"
msgid "Excellent, I'm glad to hear it. Well, good luck. I'll see\\r\nyou soon."
msgstr "Excelente, me alegra oírlo. Buena suerte. Nos vemos\\r\npronto."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "784_Shiobara"
msgid "I'll be right back, okay? Better get that five million ready\\r\nfor me!"
msgstr "Regreso enseguida. ¡Será mejor que tenga esos\\r\ncinco millones listos!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "856_Akiyama"
msgid "Invite a hostess out after the club closes and bring her\\r\nback here to my office."
msgstr "Invita a una hostess a salir cuando su club cierre y luego\\r\ntráela aquí a mi oficina."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "880_Shiobara"
msgid "A hostess club? That's it? I just bring the girl here and\\r\nthe five million's mine?"
msgstr "¿De un cabaret club? ¿Nada más? ¿Basta con traer a la\\r\nchica a este lugar y los cinco millones son míos?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "892_Shiobara"
msgid "I don't know..."
msgstr "No lo sé..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "904_Akiyama"
msgid "Oh, come on. It should be a piece of cake for a guy like\\r\nyou! What's the problem?"
msgstr "¡Oh, vamos! Debería ser pan comido para un tipo como tú.\\r\n¿Cuál es el problema?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "916_Shiobara"
msgid "I just don't have the cash. Hostess clubs are expensive, you\\r\nknow? It's a real shame..."
msgstr "Verá yo... no tengo dinero.\\r\nY esos clubes son carísimos, ¿no?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "928_P_sitsofa_tlk_kamae"
msgid "I'd have all kinds of girls trailing after me if I just had\\r\nthe money. I'd be like the Pied Piper of Kamurocho!"
msgstr "Si tuviera el dinero, tendría a todas las chicas detrás de\\r\nmí. ¡Sería el Don Juan de Kamurocho!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "940_Akiyama"
msgid "I guess I'll have to point you over to my friend's hostess\\r\nclub, then. You can put it on my tab."
msgstr "Supongo que no hay de otra. Te mandaré al cabaret club\\r\nde un amigo. Puedes poner todo en mi cuenta."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "952_Hana"
msgid "The place is called Sweet, over on Pink Street. Just tell them Akiyama sent you and they'll take care of the rest."
msgstr "El lugar se llama Sweet, y está en la calle Pink. Diles que Akiyama te envió y ellos se encargarán del resto."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "964_Shiobara"
msgid "Really?"
msgstr "¿De verdad?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "976_Akiyama"
msgid "You can't do it without money, right? Well, I'm making that\\r\nparticular problem go away. So what do you think? Can you\\r\ndo that?"
msgstr "No puedes hacer nada sin dinero, ¿no? Bueno, me encargaré\\r\nde que eso no sea un problema. ¿Qué dices? ¿Crees poder\\r\nhacerlo?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "988_Shiobara"
msgid "Yes, of course! No problem at all. I'll bring you the best\\r\nhostess in the club!"
msgstr "¡Por supuesto! ¡Iré ahora mismo!\\r\n¡Le traeré a la hostess número uno!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1000_Hana"
msgid "I'll be right back, okay? Better get that five million ready\\r\nfor me!"
msgstr "Regreso enseguida. ¡Será mejor que tenga esos\\r\ncinco millones listos!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1048_Hana"
msgid "Find three business partners."
msgstr "Encuentra tres socios comerciales."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1060_Hana"
msgid "Bring me ten presidents' business cards."
msgstr "Tráeme diez tarjetas de presentación."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1072_Hana"
msgid "Invite a hostess here after the club closes."
msgstr "Trae a una hostess aquí después de que cierre su club."

